words:'cinema circus clown magician magical puppet imagination amaze flash glow cheerful joyful',pages:[
['Lena managed a small cinema beside an old circus. She loved the cheerful crowd outside, but she had never entered the circus herself. One evening, a clown invited her to see a magician whose show was said to be magical. Lena expected an enjoyable hour, nothing more.','Lena 管理著舊馬戲團旁的小電影院。她喜歡外頭開朗熱鬧的人群，自己卻從未走進馬戲團。某天晚上，一名小丑邀請她觀看魔術師的表演，據說十分神奇。Lena 原本只期待度過愉快的一小時。'],
['A puppet moved across the stage, guided by threads too thin to see. A sudden flash filled the tent, and the lights went out. When they returned, the puppet was gone. A pale glow remained on the curtain, shaped like a doorway. The audience cheered, but Lena noticed the magician looked frightened.','一個木偶走過舞台，牽引它的細線幾乎看不見。突然一道閃光照滿帳篷，燈光隨即熄滅。燈再亮時，木偶不見了。幕布上只剩一道蒼白微光，形狀像扇門。觀眾歡呼，但 Lena 注意到魔術師看起來很害怕。'],
['The clown tried to amaze everyone with another trick. Lena did not smile. Her imagination offered several explanations, but none explained why the magician had whispered, “That door was not in my show.” A joyful evening had become a question she could not ignore.','小丑又表演了一個戲法，想讓所有人驚嘆。Lena 卻笑不出來。她的想像力提出好幾種解釋，沒有一種能說明魔術師為何低聲說：「那扇門不在我的表演裡。」原本快樂的夜晚變成一個她無法忽略的問題。']],
