words:'summit mathematical minus multiply subtract sum roughly probable advanced enable',pages:[
['The professor invited Noor to a small laboratory near the summit. An advanced sensor could measure changes that the old machine had missed. But its numbers did not explain themselves. Noor needed a mathematical way to compare the two sets of readings.','教授邀請 Noor 到山頂附近的一間小實驗室。先進感測器能測出舊機器漏掉的變化，但數字不會自行解釋。Noor 需要用數學方法比較兩組讀數。'],
['She showed the team a simple example: multiply the hourly reading by the number of hours, then subtract the missing period. “Minus” meant taking one amount away from another, and the final sum had to match the recorded total. The first estimate was roughly correct, but not accurate enough for a public report.','她向團隊示範簡單例子：把每小時讀數乘上時數，再扣除缺漏時段。「減去」就是從一個數量扣掉另一個；最後的總數必須與紀錄相符。第一次估算大致正確，但還不夠精準，不能直接寫進公開報告。'],
['After repeating the calculations, Noor said the battery was the probable cause of the long gap in the data. The new procedure would enable future workers to notice missing equipment immediately. She sent the results to the village, relieved that a mystery had become a problem people could actually solve.','重做計算後，Noor 說電池很可能是資料長期中斷的原因。新程序將使未來工作人員能立即注意到缺少的設備。她把結果寄回村子，慶幸謎團終於變成大家有辦法解決的問題。']],
quiz:[['What did the advanced sensor do?','Measure changes the old machine missed','Repair the village cinema','Predict an election result','Locate a stolen jewel','新感測器能測量舊機器漏掉的變化。'],['Why was the first estimate unsuitable?','It was not accurate enough','It was written in Chinese','It contained too many pictures','It was too cheerful','第一次估計還不夠準確。'],['What could the new procedure enable?','Noticing missing equipment quickly','Avoiding all future storms','Replacing all workers','Making the mountain shorter','新程序讓缺漏設備更容易被發現。']]
